  "description": "Compare Proxmox-reported guest CPU/memory (InfluxDB, PVE metric server) with node exporter (inside the VM) and cAdvisor container totals. Select a Proxmox guest — node and cAdvisor targets are linked automatically via the proxmox_guest label in Alloy.",
