  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 18,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "markdown", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "**How to use:** pick a Proxmox guest — Alloy links node exporter and cAdvisor via the `proxmox_guest` label.\n\n| Guest | Node instance | cAdvisor |\n|---|---|---|\n| [lab-pgdb](?var-guest=lab-pgdb) | database-vm | yes — no Proxmox guest of this name in InfluxDB |\n| [prod-apps](?var-guest=prod-apps) | prod-docker-server | yes |\n| [monitoring-stack](?var-guest=monitoring-stack) | — | yes (local cadvisor) |\n| [Alpine-Jellyfin](?var-guest=Alpine-Jellyfin) | zinohub (192.168.0.33) | **no** — Docker runs on the VM but cAdvisor is not deployed there |\n| [qbit-linux](?var-guest=qbit-linux) | qbit | no |\n| [ark](?var-guest=ark) | ark-server (on-demand) | yes |\n| [mc-server](?var-guest=mc-server) | minecraft (on-demand) | no |\n| [ng-alpine](?var-guest=ng-alpine) | nginx | no |\n\nProxmox guest CPU is % of allocated vCPUs. Node exporter CPU is % of all VM cores. cAdvisor CPU is container CPU summed and normalized to VM core count.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Mapping guide",
      "type": "text"
    },
